 "remarks": "Filled with natural light, this inviting two-bedroom, two-and-a-half-bath townhouse offers comfortable living and exciting potential. The compact, thoughtfully arranged kitchen keeps everything conveniently within reach, while the bright living spaces create a warm and airy atmosphere. An unfinished attic presents an exceptional opportunity to add approximately 400 square feet of finished living space--ideal for a home office, den, gym or guest retreat. Enjoy the ease of townhouse living along with a beautiful community pool, perfect for summer relaxation.",
